# --- secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
# Wallet seeds and keys must never reach the repository. Patterns without a
# slash match at ANY depth, so `contract/.env` is covered by `.env`.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*seed*.txt
*-sk-*.txt
*.pem
*.key

# Generated wallets and wallet sync state. These hold SEEDS and admin secret
# keys in plain text — `wallets/preprod_deployer_wallet.json` carries both, and
# the 73-wallet files carry 73 more. Nothing here may ever reach the repository.
wallets/
*_wallet.json
*_wallets.json
*_wallets.csv
.sync-cache/
contract/.sync-cache/
PREPROD_*_USERS.md
